{"seq":4,"slug":"edge-and-serverless","title":"边缘与 Serverless","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/deployment/edge-and-serverless","wordCount":876,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"边缘与-serverless\">边缘与 Serverless</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Serverless 与边缘计算要求数据库尽可能贴近执行节点，而中心化数据库带来的跨区域延迟正是瓶颈所在。SQLite 的轻量与零配置使其成为<strong>边缘数据库</strong>的理想底座：Cloudflare D1、Turso 等把 SQLite 副本放到靠近用户的节点，以本地读取换取低延迟。这一模式在带来 1-5ms 读取延迟的同时，也带来最终一致性与写入单主等限制。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"sqlite-在边缘的崛起\">SQLite 在边缘的崛起</h2><p>传统的 Serverless 架构中，数据库通常是中心化的，函数执行节点需要跨区域访问远程数据库，产生显著的网络延迟。<strong>边缘数据库</strong>（Edge Database）将数据推向靠近用户的边缘节点，从根本上解决延迟问题。SQLite 的轻量级和零配置特性使其成为边缘数据库的理想选择。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 传统 Serverless&#10;        USER1[用户&lt;br/&gt;亚太] --&gt;|请求| FUNC1[函数节点&lt;br/&gt;亚太]&#10;        FUNC1 --&gt;|跨区域查询&lt;br/&gt;高延迟| DB_CENTER[(中心数据库&lt;br/&gt;美东)]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 边缘 SQLite&#10;        USER2[用户&lt;br/&gt;亚太] --&gt;|请求| EDGE1[边缘节点&lt;br/&gt;亚太]&#10;        EDGE1 --&gt;|本地查询&lt;br/&gt;低延迟| DB_EDGE[(SQLite 副本&lt;br/&gt;亚太)]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 传统 Serverless\n        USER1[用户&lt;br/&gt;亚太] --&gt;|请求| FUNC1[函数节点&lt;br/&gt;亚太]\n        FUNC1 --&gt;|跨区域查询&lt;br/&gt;高延迟| DB_CENTER[(中心数据库&lt;br/&gt;美东)]\n    end\n    subgraph 边缘 SQLite\n        USER2[用户&lt;br/&gt;亚太] --&gt;|请求| EDGE1[边缘节点&lt;br/&gt;亚太]\n        EDGE1 --&gt;|本地查询&lt;br/&gt;低延迟| DB_EDGE[(SQLite 副本&lt;br/&gt;亚太)]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>中心化数据库</th>\n<th>边缘 SQLite</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>读取延迟</td>\n<td>50-200ms</td>\n<td>1-5ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冷启动</td>\n<td>连接池预热</td>\n<td>文件打开即用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩展方式</td>\n<td>垂直扩展</td>\n<td>水平分布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据一致性</td>\n<td>强一致</td>\n<td>最终一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写入架构</td>\n<td>任意节点</td>\n<td>通常单主</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"cloudflare-d1\">Cloudflare D1</h2><p><strong>D1</strong> 是 Cloudflare 基于 SQLite 构建的 Serverless 数据库，运行在 Cloudflare 的边缘网络上，与 Workers 深度集成。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"export interface Env {&#10;  DB: D1Database;&#10;}&#10;&#10;export default {&#10;  async fetch(request: Request, env: Env): Promise&lt;Response&gt; {&#10;    const { results } = await env.DB.prepare(&#39;SELECT * FROM users WHERE city = ?&#39;).bind(&#39;北京&#39;).all();&#10;&#10;    return Response.json(results);&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  DB</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> D1Database</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  async</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">request</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">env</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Response</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">results</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">DB</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">prepare</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SELECT * FROM users WHERE city = ?'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'北京'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Response.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(results);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>D1 的核心操作：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"export default {&#10;  async fetch(request: Request, env: Env): Promise&lt;Response&gt; {&#10;    const stmt = env.DB.prepare(&#39;INSERT INTO users (name, email) VALUES (?, ?)&#39;);&#10;    await stmt.bind(&#39;Alice&#39;, &#39;alice@example.com&#39;).run();&#10;&#10;    const user = await env.DB.prepare(&#39;SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ?&#39;).bind(1).first();&#10;&#10;    const batch = await env.DB.batch([&#10;      env.DB.prepare(&#39;INSERT INTO logs (msg) VALUES (?)&#39;).bind(&#39;操作1&#39;),&#10;      env.DB.prepare(&#39;INSERT INTO logs (msg) VALUES (?)&#39;).bind(&#39;操作2&#39;),&#10;    ]);&#10;&#10;    return Response.json({ user, batch });&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  async</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">request</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">env</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Response</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> stmt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">DB</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">prepare</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'INSERT INTO users (name, email) VALUES (?, ?)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stmt.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'alice@example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> user</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">DB</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">prepare</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ?'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">first</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> batch</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">DB</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">batch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">DB</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">prepare</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'INSERT INTO logs (msg) VALUES (?)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'操作1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">DB</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">prepare</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'INSERT INTO logs (msg) VALUES (?)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'操作2'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Response.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ user, batch });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>D1 特性</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>存储位置</td>\n<td>Cloudflare 边缘网络</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>读取模型</td>\n<td>全球边缘只读副本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写入模型</td>\n<td>单主写入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大数据库大小</td>\n<td>10GB（商业计划）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>兼容性</td>\n<td>SQLite 语法子集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定价</td>\n<td>按读写操作量和存储量计费</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- D1 支持的 SQLite 特性&#10;CREATE TABLE products (&#10;    id   INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,&#10;    name TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;    meta TEXT&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- JSON 函数&#10;SELECT json_extract(meta, &#39;$.brand&#39;) FROM products;&#10;&#10;-- 窗口函数&#10;SELECT name, ROW_NUMBER() OVER (ORDER BY id) FROM products;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- D1 支持的 SQLite 特性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> products</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AUTOINCREMENT,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    meta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- JSON 函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> json_extract(meta, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'$.brand'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> products;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 窗口函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ROW_NUMBER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> products;</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> D1 的读操作在全球边缘执行，延迟极低。写操作路由到主数据库所在区域，延迟取决于用户到主区域的距离。对于读多写少的应用，D1 的性能表现极为出色。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"turso-边缘部署\">Turso 边缘部署</h2><p><strong>Turso</strong> 基于 libsql 提供全球分布式 SQLite，支持在多个边缘区域部署只读副本：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { createClient } from &#39;@libsql/client&#39;;&#10;&#10;const db = createClient({&#10;  url: process.env.TURSO_DATABASE_URL!,&#10;  authToken: process.env.TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN!,&#10;});&#10;&#10;const result = await db.execute({&#10;  sql: &#39;SELECT * FROM articles WHERE published = ? ORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT ?&#39;,&#10;  args: [1, 20],&#10;});&#10;&#10;const tx = await db.transaction(&#39;write&#39;);&#10;await tx.execute({&#10;  sql: &#39;INSERT INTO articles (title, body) VALUES (?, ?)&#39;,&#10;  args: [&#39;新文章&#39;, &#39;文章内容...&#39;],&#10;});&#10;await tx.execute({&#10;  sql: &#39;UPDATE stats SET article_count = article_count + 1 WHERE id = 1&#39;,&#10;  args: [],&#10;});&#10;await tx.commit();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { createClient } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@libsql/client'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> db</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createClient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  url: process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">TURSO_DATABASE_URL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  authToken: process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sql: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SELECT * FROM articles WHERE published = ? ORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT ?'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  args: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">transaction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'write'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sql: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'INSERT INTO articles (title, body) VALUES (?, ?)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  args: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'新文章'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'文章内容...'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sql: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'UPDATE stats SET article_count = article_count + 1 WHERE id = 1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  args: [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">commit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph Turso 全球部署&#10;        PRIMARY[主数据库&lt;br/&gt;美东] --&gt; ASIA[亚太副本]&#10;        PRIMARY --&gt; EU[欧洲副本]&#10;        PRIMARY --&gt; SA[南美副本]&#10;    end&#10;    APP1[亚太应用] --&gt; ASIA&#10;    APP2[欧洲应用] --&gt; EU\">graph LR\n    subgraph Turso 全球部署\n        PRIMARY[主数据库&lt;br/&gt;美东] --&gt; ASIA[亚太副本]\n        PRIMARY --&gt; EU[欧洲副本]\n        PRIMARY --&gt; SA[南美副本]\n    end\n    APP1[亚太应用] --&gt; ASIA\n    APP2[欧洲应用] --&gt; EU</pre><p>Turso 与 D1 对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Cloudflare D1</th>\n<th>Turso</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基础引擎</td>\n<td>SQLite</td>\n<td>libsql（SQLite 分支）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部署模型</td>\n<td>Cloudflare 生态</td>\n<td>独立部署</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本地开发</td>\n<td>Wrangler CLI</td>\n<td>本地 SQLite 文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌入式副本</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>向量搜索</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开源</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>libsql 开源</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"边缘-worker-模式\">边缘 Worker 模式</h2><p>在 Serverless 函数中使用 SQLite 的通用模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface EdgeDbConfig {&#10;  primaryUrl: string;&#10;  replicaUrl?: string;&#10;  authToken: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function createEdgeDb(config: EdgeDbConfig) {&#10;  const readClient = createClient({&#10;    url: config.replicaUrl ?? config.primaryUrl,&#10;    authToken: config.authToken,&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  const writeClient = createClient({&#10;    url: config.primaryUrl,&#10;    authToken: config.authToken,&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return {&#10;    read: readClient,&#10;    write: writeClient,&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EdgeDbConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  primaryUrl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  replicaUrl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  authToken</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createEdgeDb</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EdgeDbConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> readClient</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createClient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    url: config.replicaUrl </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config.primaryUrl,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    authToken: config.authToken,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> writeClient</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createClient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    url: config.primaryUrl,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    authToken: config.authToken,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    read: readClient,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    write: writeClient,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    REQUEST[用户请求] --&gt; ROUTER[边缘路由]&#10;    ROUTER --&gt;|读请求| READ[最近的只读副本]&#10;    ROUTER --&gt;|写请求| WRITE[主数据库]&#10;    READ --&gt; RESPONSE[响应]&#10;    WRITE --&gt; RESPONSE\">graph TD\n    REQUEST[用户请求] --&gt; ROUTER[边缘路由]\n    ROUTER --&gt;|读请求| READ[最近的只读副本]\n    ROUTER --&gt;|写请求| WRITE[主数据库]\n    READ --&gt; RESPONSE[响应]\n    WRITE --&gt; RESPONSE</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"适用场景与限制\">适用场景与限制</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>不适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内容管理系统</td>\n<td>高频写入应用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户配置和偏好</td>\n<td>实时协作编辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>API 响应缓存</td>\n<td>大规模事务处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地理化内容分发</td>\n<td>复杂的跨表事务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>功能开关和 A/B 测试</td>\n<td>需要强一致性的金融系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边缘认证和授权</td>\n<td>数据量超过 10GB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 边缘 SQLite 最佳实践&#10;&#10;-- 1. 读写分离：读操作在边缘，写操作路由到主库&#10;-- 2. 幂等写入：边缘环境可能重试请求&#10;CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS idempotency_keys (&#10;    key       TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    result    TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;    created_at TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT (strftime(&#39;%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ&#39;, &#39;now&#39;))&#10;) STRICT, WITHOUT ROWID;&#10;&#10;-- 3. 合理利用缓存&#10;-- 边缘节点的 SQLite 副本本身就是一层缓存\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 边缘 SQLite 最佳实践</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 1. 读写分离：读操作在边缘，写操作路由到主库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 2. 幂等写入：边缘环境可能重试请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IF</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXISTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idempotency_keys (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (strftime(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'now'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) STRICT, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITHOUT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ROWID;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 3. 合理利用缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 边缘节点的 SQLite 副本本身就是一层缓存</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 边缘 SQLite 最大的优势是将<strong>读操作的延迟降到最低</strong>。设计应用时应尽量将读密集型逻辑放在边缘执行，写操作通过异步队列或直接路由到主数据库。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((边缘与 Serverless))&#10;    边缘优势&#10;      读延迟 1-5ms&#10;      零冷启动&#10;      全球分布&#10;    Cloudflare D1&#10;      Workers 集成&#10;      全球只读副本&#10;      按量计费&#10;    Turso&#10;      libsql 引擎&#10;      嵌入式副本&#10;      向量搜索&#10;    设计模式&#10;      读写分离&#10;      幂等写入&#10;      边缘即缓存&#10;    限制&#10;      单主写入&#10;      最终一致&#10;      数据量上限\">mindmap\n  root((边缘与 Serverless))\n    边缘优势\n      读延迟 1-5ms\n      零冷启动\n      全球分布\n    Cloudflare D1\n      Workers 集成\n      全球只读副本\n      按量计费\n    Turso\n      libsql 引擎\n      嵌入式副本\n      向量搜索\n    设计模式\n      读写分离\n      幂等写入\n      边缘即缓存\n    限制\n      单主写入\n      最终一致\n      数据量上限</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>边缘 SQLite</strong> 将数据推向靠近用户的节点，读取延迟从 50-200ms 降至 1-5ms。</li>\n<li><strong>Cloudflare D1</strong> 与 Workers 深度集成，适合 Cloudflare 生态内的应用。</li>\n<li><strong>Turso</strong> 基于 libsql，支持嵌入式副本和向量搜索，部署更灵活。</li>\n<li>边缘架构的核心模式是<strong>读写分离</strong>：边缘节点处理读请求，主数据库处理写请求。</li>\n<li>边缘 SQLite 适合<strong>读多写少</strong>的场景，不适合高频写入或需要强一致性的应用。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"边缘与 Serverless","id":"边缘与-serverless"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"SQLite 在边缘的崛起","id":"sqlite-在边缘的崛起"},{"level":2,"text":"Cloudflare D1","id":"cloudflare-d1"},{"level":2,"text":"Turso 边缘部署","id":"turso-边缘部署"},{"level":2,"text":"边缘 Worker 模式","id":"边缘-worker-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"适用场景与限制","id":"适用场景与限制"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"嵌入模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/deployment/embedded-patterns"},"next":null}